cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BrowseTrace: Request-Level Traffic Characterization of Browser-Mediated AI Agents"
message: "Please cite this research software and dataset. It is not a conference publication."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Landi
    given-names: Gennaro Francesco
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/landigf/BrowseTrace"
url: "https://landigf.github.io/browsetrace.html"
keywords:
  - web measurement
  - browser automation
  - HTTP traces
  - caching
  - reproducibility
abstract: >
  Request-level browser workload traces with collection code, sanitization tools
  and offline cache replay. The public aggregate CSVs contain 82,455 scripted
  request rows and 357,782 LLM-labelled request rows. The September 2026 replay
  reports request and byte hit rates, input hashes and release limitations.
